      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Pattern of the series  -  </p><p>98 + (12 * 1) = 110</p><p>110  -  (12 * 2) = 86</p><p>86 + (12 * 3) = 122</p><p>122  -  (12 * 4) = 74</p><p>74 + (12 * 5) = 134</p><p>134 is the missing term in the series.</p>",
